Monthly interest rate \(r = 0.065/12\). The payment for a loan repaid in \(n=48\) equal monthly installments is
\[
P = \frac{L\,r}{1-(1+r)^{-n}}
\]
with \(L=18000\).

\[
P=\frac{18000(0.065/12)}{1-(1+0.065/12)^{-48}}
\approx \frac{97.5000}{1-0.76423538}
\approx \frac{97.5000}{0.23576462}
\approx 413.55
\]

